* S5B_WATCHDOG_IDLE -- BEHAVIOURAL, datasheet timing (see H2C_SEQUENCING_SIM.md)
* Watchdog while ARMED but idle (gates pinched -1.75 V, no PA current): WDT_OK low at 141.0 ms.
* Drain discharge then relies on TPS22810 QOD only (RPD 400 ohm worst case).
* Common: VIN 0->12 V in 1 ms; MCU at 8 ms asserts PWR_EN_3V3/5VPA/NEG; PA_BIAS OFF -1.75 V at 140.0 ms,
* MCU_PA_EN at 140.2 ms, gates ON -1.1 V at 141.0 ms unless stated.
.include h2c_plant.inc
VVIN vin 0 PWL(0 0 1m 12)
VE3 fw_en3v3  0 PWL(0 0 8m 0 8.001m 1)
VE5 fw_en5vpa 0 PWL(0 0 8m 0 8.001m 1)
VEN fw_enneg  0 PWL(0 0 8m 0 8.001m 1)
VWD fw_wdt    0 PWL(0 0 8m 0 8.001m 1 141m 1 141.001m 0)
VKL ldo5_kill 0 0
VRK rf_kill   0 0
VTLW tlw 0 0
VFR1 fr_aux 0 0
VFR2 fr_18 0 0
VFR3 fr_rf 0 0
VFR4 fr_pa 0 0
VFR5 fr_n5 0 0
VFR6 fr_n3 0 0
VPA fw_pa_en  0 PWL(0 0 140.2m 0 140.201m 1)
VD1 dac1 0 PWL(0 0 140m 0 140.001m -1.75)
VD2 dac2 0 PWL(0 0 140m 0 140.001m -1.75)
VD3 dac3 0 PWL(0 0 140m 0 140.001m -1.75)
VD4 dac4 0 PWL(0 0 140m 0 140.001m -1.75)
.tran 1u 165m 0 20u
.end
